-- LAYER-1 TESTS for the Part 6 sections and subsections in sgta-part6-more.l4, Part 7 (ss 72 to 77) and the rest of Part 8 (ss 78 to 83).
-- Expected values are written by hand from the quoted text.  Money figures are the ceilings the Act names; 10% of turnover against $1 million
-- (s 77(6)) is tested on both sides.

